  "wordLifeBeats": 8,
  "lyrics": [
    {"beat": 8, "text": "Oh the ^PICTURES are a-playing and the ^ORGAN starts to hum,", "at": [0.0, 0.75, 1.25, 2.0, 2.5, 3.25, 3.75, 4.5, 5.0, 5.75, 6.25]},
    {"beat": 16, "text": "So take a seat and ^FOLLOW where the ^BOUNCING ball will come!", "at": [0.0, 0.5, 1.25, 1.75, 2.25, 3.0, 3.5, 4.0, 4.75, 5.25, 5.75, 6.5]},
    {"beat": 24, "text": "Just ^HOP upon the words, my friend, and ^SING along with me,", "at": [0.0, 0.5, 1.25, 1.75, 2.25, 3.0, 3.5, 4.0, 4.75, 5.25, 5.75, 6.5]},
    {"beat": 32, "text": "The ^CLOCK may say it's late, but late's the ^BEST time there can be!", "at": [0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0, 2.5, 3.0, 3.5, 4.0, 4.5, 5.0, 5.5, 6.0, 6.5]},
    {"beat": 40, "text": "Oh the ^SEATS are all so empty and the ^AISLES are full of dust,", "at": [0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0, 2.5, 3.0, 3.5, 4.0, 4.5, 5.0, 5.5, 6.0, 6.5]},
    {"beat": 48, "text": "But a ^SONG is like a ^LANTERN, and you sing it 'cause you must!", "at": [0.0, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5, 2.0, 2.5, 3.0, 3.5, 4.0, 4.5, 5.0, 5.5, 6.0, 6.5]},
    {"beat": 56, "text": "So ^TICK along and ^TOCK along, the ^REEL is spinning round,", "at": [0.0, 0.75, 1.25, 2.0, 2.5, 3.25, 3.75, 4.5, 5.0, 5.75, 6.25]},
    {"beat": 64, "text": "And ^NOBODY is lonely when the ^MUSIC makes a sound!", "at": [0.0, 0.75, 1.5, 2.0, 2.75, 3.5, 4.25, 5.0, 5.5, 6.25]}
  ],
